{"title":"Average","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Average</b> could refer to:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Average_(Arithmetic)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Average (Arithmetic)\">Average (Arithmetic)</a> - the \"middle\" of a group of numbers.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Average_(Calculus)\" title=\"Average (Calculus)\">Average (Calculus)</a> - in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calculus\" title=\"Calculus\">calculus</a> - The average value of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Closed_interval\" title=\"Closed interval\">closed interval</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><i>This is a disambiguation page.  The title you requested could refer to one of the articles listed on this page.</i>\n</p><p>If you were referred to this page through an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Average\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Average\">internal link</a> and you believe that a direct link to a specific article would be more appropriate, feel free to help us out by changing the link on that page.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018074016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 398/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.752      1 Template:Disambig\n100.00%    6.752      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7005:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018074016 and revision id 26448. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}